| Skills (`.chatui/`) | ✓ kept | ✗ removed | ✗ removed | `ALWAYS_EXCLUDE_DIRS` |
| Uploads (`uploads/`) | ✓ kept | ✗ removed | ✗ removed | `ALWAYS_EXCLUDE_DIRS` |
| Session caches (`.project_sessions/`) | ✓ kept | ✗ removed | ✗ removed | `ALWAYS_EXCLUDE_DIRS` |
