| Databases (`*.db`) | ✗ removed | ✗ removed | ✗ removed | `PERSONAL_EXCLUDE_GLOBS_HEAVY`, `ALWAYS_EXCLUDE_DIRS` |
| Logs (`logs/`, `*.log`) | ✗ removed | ✗ removed | ✗ removed | `PERSONAL_EXCLUDE_DIRS`, `ALWAYS_EXCLUDE_DIRS` |
